      "message": "feat(phase-0.2): TASK-6: Update workspace.rs enumerate_members to return MissingWorkspaceSection error"
    },
    {
      "hash": "8aa8507",
      "message": "feat(phase-0.2): TASK-7: Refactor lib.rs run(): parallel error collection, error entry construction, remove unwrap_or_default"
    },
    {
      "hash": "a44c48e",
      "message": "feat(phase-0.2): TASK-5: Refactor module_tree.rs: fix path fallbacks, add error collection, change build_module_tree return type"
    },
    {
