      "message": "feat(phase-0.2): TASK-3: Expand ErrorEntry struct with severity, kind, context, and cause fields"
    },
    {
      "hash": "99dbae6",
      "message": "feat(phase-0.2): TASK-2: Add MissingWorkspaceSection variant to Error enum in schema.rs"
    },
